name: Bloodstone — heart X1.5
author: corpus
description: >-
  Bloodstone has a 1 in 2 chance for each played Heart card to give X1.5 Mult when scored.
  First-shop heart X-mult: Oops All 6s makes it guaranteed; Lusty Joker and Heart-heavy
  decks support it.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Bloodstone
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: LustyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
